        "Ahmedabad's demand for flanges and fittings comes mainly from Chemicals & dyes, pharmaceuticals, engineering, auto (Sanand belt). Chemical and process plants buy SS 316L and 304L flanges and butt-weld fittings for corrosive lines, moving to duplex 2205 or super duplex where chlorides are present. For API and formulation plants the standard is 304L/316L stainless with a 3.1 certificate per heat, used on solvent, purified-water and utility lines. Engineering and auto-component workshops order 3000# and 6000# forged fittings, threaded and slip-on flanges and hydraulic couplings in A105 and SS 304/316.",
        "Orders for Ahmedabad leave our Mumbai stock within 24–48 hours and travel by road on NH48 direct (~530 km), so material is usually on site in about 1 day. Custom forgings and non-stock sizes take 7–15 working days. To quote quickly we need the size (NPS or DN), pressure class, facing (RF, FF or RTJ), material grade and the schedule of the mating pipe.",
