      {
        "q": "What is the MOQ for Ahmedabad supply?",
        "a": "We keep MOQs low for the Ahmedabad corridor — small lots are clubbed with our scheduled dispatches on this route, so a single-item trial order is workable. Project-quantity rates apply from roughly 100 pieces or 500 kg per grade."
      }
