        "a": "We deliver Blind Flanges, Slip On Flanges, Butt Weld Elbows and Hardox Plates to Rourkela in A105, A350 LF2, SS 304, dimensioned to ASME B16.5, B16.47 and B16.11. Demand here comes mainly from steel & metals and fertilizers — including units around Kalunga & Mandiakudar industrial estates — and every lot ships with EN 10204 3.1 certification."
